```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant LLM as LLM
    participant V as Zod Validator
    participant Ctx as Agent Context

    loop Multi-step workflow
        LLM->>Ctx: Prepare messages with the last 3 errors from earlier steps
        LLM->>V: Structured output
        alt Valid
